OL,3,GNEWSACuts to library services to be
OL,4,Adiscussed
OL,5,
OL,6,FShropshire's six main libraries could
OL,7,Fhave their opening hours cut and two
OL,8,Fother libraries could close under plans
OL,9,Fdue to be discussed by councillors.
OL,11,FThere is also a proposal to end
OL,12,FShropshire Council's mobile library
OL,13,Fservice.
OL,15,FThe local authority, which is due to
OL,16,Freceive #192.8m from the government to
OL,17,Fhelp it keep running, said it was
OL,18,Fhaving to look at the services in light
OL,19,Fof "significantly reduced financial
OL,20,Fresources".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
